Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every family has a beginning. Ours\Nbegins at the old walls of Harar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My great-grandparents came here as\Nstrangers, carrying little more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They were tailors. Stitch by stitch,\Nthey built a life with their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Their children became merchants. The\Nstitches became trade, and the trade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,became a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What they earned, they saved, for the\Nones who would come after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother worked in the market by day,\Nand carried her schoolbooks with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At night, when she was tired, she\Nstudied anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day, she graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she worked long hours in an office,\Nand gave everything she had so that I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,could learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I graduated in software engineering,\Nwith honours. Today, I work on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I have is mine alone. It is the\Nwork of everyone who came before me. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it is my turn to take us a little\Nfurther.
